 loader (returns unregister function)"],[613,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[611,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1545,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize."],[1043,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[593,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[1719,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[597,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1285,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1487,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1543,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1090,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1604,"**Arrow Left / Right**"],[1216,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[808,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[807,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1091,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[1735,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[590,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[644,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[1731,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[1730,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[595,"**Bento integration**: Extends Ben