ose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[892,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1248,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[761,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[663,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[759,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[895,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1250,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1489,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1544,"**Controls keep their own type.** A `Button` inside a lockup is sized by its own `size` prop,\nnot the lockup's."],[1488,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[1911,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1717,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1716,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1773,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[651,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1714,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[653,"**DOM Output:**"],[1610,"**End**"],[598,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1539,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Anything unslotted is\nleft alone, which is what lets a nested component keep its own internal text. Forget the slot\nand the text simply renders untypeset rather than erroring."],[669,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[657,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[642,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[591,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1252,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[645,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1732,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1744,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1608,"**Home**"],[1747,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1736,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1910,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1901,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[620,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data 