sibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1253,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[1938,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[655,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[650,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1713,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1745,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1629,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1718,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1743,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1740,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1213,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1214,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1276,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[289,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1774,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1711,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1249,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[758,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[1606,"**Space / Enter**"],[1092,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[288,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[806,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1217,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[649,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[659,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1284,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[893,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon, `variant=\"control\"`, and `size` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1748,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1737,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[599,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[643,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1602,"**Tab**"],[287,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1089,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1215,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1542,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1540,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1541,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1044,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles