ite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[896,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1251,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1491,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[894,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1770,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1712,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1746,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1721,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[648,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1344,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1341,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1350,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1351,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1339,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1345,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1348,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1342,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1354,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[154,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[1955,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1957,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1951,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[1953,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[1958,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[1954,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1952,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1956,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1908,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[545,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1